# Flutter toolchain

Flutter is installed and works in this project. It is **not** on the agent shell's global `PATH` — do not assume `flutter` or `dart` work bare.

## Commands

From the repo root, always use the wrapper:

```powershell
cd c:\Users\Zeus\Projects\TimeSheet
.\scripts\flutter.bat pub get
.\scripts\flutter.bat analyze
.\scripts\flutter.bat test
.\scripts\flutter.bat run
```

On Git Bash / MSYS, use `scripts/resolve_flutter.sh` the same way other scripts do.

## SDK location

`scripts/flutter.bat` resolves in order:

1. `TimeSheet/.tools/flutter/bin/flutter.bat` (local vendored SDK)
2. `../Cashy/.tools/flutter/bin/flutter.bat` (shared sibling repo — **currently used**)

JDK for Android builds: `../Cashy/.tools/jdk-21` when present (wrapper sets `JAVA_HOME`).

If a command fails with "Flutter SDK not found", check those paths before telling the user Flutter is missing.
